{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"TIA \u2014 Project Server groups"},"description":"Lists the project groups of one Project Server as {server, groups:[{name}], total}; `server` is the connection name from tia_project_servers (exact name first, then ignoring case) and comes back resolved. Contacts the Project Server with the Windows user of the serve. An unknown name is 404 not_found (details.available lists the names that work), a name that matches several is 409 ambiguous_name (details.matches), and a Project Server that is unreachable or refuses the Windows user of the serve is 502 project_server_error (details.server, operation, type, message). Needs a running TIA Portal on the serve host (tia_start) but no open project. Maps to GET /multiuser/servers/{server}/groups. Read-only (class R).","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","properties":{"server":{"description":"Project Server connection name (from tia_project_servers)","type":"string"}},"required":["server"],"type":"object"},"name":"tia_project_server_groups","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"groups":{"anyOf":[{"items":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"}},"required":["name"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":{},"properties":{"chars":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"hint":{"type":"string"},"items":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"limitChars":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":-9007199254740991,"type":"integer"},"omitted":{"const":true,"type":"boolean"},"path":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"enum":["value_too_large","response_too_large"],"type":"string"},"valueType":{"enum":["string","array","object"],"type":"string"}},"required":["omitted","reason","path","valueT